# Packaging manifest for the VS Code extension: only what the extension host loads.
#
# `dist/` holds the bundled entry named by package.json `main`, and `media/` holds
# the activity-bar icon declared in `contributes`; `package.json` itself is the
# manifest. Everything listed below is development input and is never read at
# runtime, so it is excluded from the packaged extension. Only plain exclusions
# are used, so the rules read the same to `vsce` and to a human.

# Build and dependency trees
node_modules/**
src/**
scripts/**
dist/**/*.map
dist/**/*.ts

# Development configuration and sources
**/*.ts
**/*.tsx
tsconfig.json
.gitignore

# Local artifacts
*.log
*.vsix
coverage/**
.tmp/**
